# t34-statemachine: the spec-correct behaviour of final.bzl, from the recorded final run (data/final-outputs.txt).

[case ]
stdout:
| Idle -> HasCoin(50)
| insufficient: 50 < 75
| HasCoin(50) -> HasCoin(50)
| HasCoin(50) -> HasCoin(100)
| HasCoin(100) -> Vending(25)
| vend, change 25
| nothing to refund
| Idle -> Idle
